@startuml 36-events-sync
' events-sync bidirectional ATProto <-> Firefly bridge.
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FBFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #294C60
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam rectangle { BorderColor #294C60 }

title events-sync — ATProto firehose <-> Firefly bridge

rectangle "F1r3fly node" as node #A9D0F5
rectangle "events-sync\n(init: registry contract)" as sync #D0E0E3
rectangle "ATProto consumers" as consumers #E1D5E7
rectangle "external PDS firehose" as pds #E1D5E7

node -down-> sync : listen: gRPC comm service\n(node notifies of updates)
sync -down-> consumers : listen: com.atproto.sync.subscribeRepos\n(+ merge --extra-sources)
pds -up-> sync : push: subscribe to a\nsubscribeRepos URL
sync -up-> node : push: deploy events in windows\n(flush on time OR size)

note bottom of sync
  push flush condition (Docker defaults time=3 s, size=16):
  flush <=> (now - t_start >= theta_t) OR (|W| >= theta_n)
end note
@enduml
